Hi,

The gitlab tracker said I should submit a patch here, should I be posting
this on the gitlab tracker instead?  I ran into this memory leak where the
link dies before the streams are committed and then the link data is never
freed
 [image: image.png]
and fixed it
[image: image.png]
with this patch.  so my questions are
* is this correct?
* how can I test this other than running it locally?

best,
-tom

